{"beat": 21, "name": "WHAT IT COST", "text": "And the margin moved too. Net earnings were 9.43% of sales in 1917. In 1918, 5.46%. To be fair to the record, that year also carried a federal income tax bill of $1.23 million and a reserve set against inventory, so not all of the drop was the dime. But the dime was the one thing the company had chosen not to let move, so every other cost had to land somewhere else: in the size of the product, in the supplier's margin, or in the company's own. By 1919, net earnings were back to 7.89%. The ceiling had held. Whether holding it was the most profitable choice is a question the company never had to answer, because in the East it didn't try the other one.", "provider": "placeholder", "words": [{"word": "And", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.18}, {"word": "the", "start": 0.18, "end": 0.26}, {"word": "margin", "start": 0.26, "end": 0.64}, {"word": "moved", "start": 0.64, "end": 0.98}, {"word": "too.", "start": 0.98, "end": 1.36}, {"word": "Net", "start": 2.02, "end": 2.28}, {"word": "earnings", "start": 2.28, "end": 2.62}, {"word": "were", "start": 2.62, "end": 2.86}, {"word": "9.43%", "start": 2.86, "end": 4.44}, {"word": "of", "start": 4.44, "end": 4.6}, {"word": "sales", "start": 4.6, "end": 4.94}, {"word": "in", "start": 4.94, "end": 5.24}, {"word": "1917.", "start": 5.24, "end": 6.22}, {"word": "In", "start": 7.26, "end": 7.44}, {"word": "1918,", "start": 7.44, "end": 8.26}, {"word": "5.46%.", "start": 9.16, "end": 11.02}, {"word": "To", "start": 11.02, "end": 11.66}, {"word": "be", "start": 11.66, "end": 11.78}, {"word": "fair", "start": 11.78, "end": 12.04}, {"word": "to", "start": 12.04, "end": 12.2}, {"word": "the", "start": 12.2, "end": 12.36}, {"word": "record,", "start": 12.36, "end": 12.68}, {"word": "that", "start": 13.2, "end": 13.32}, {"word": "year", "start": 13.32, "end": 13.52}, {"word": "also", "start": 13.52, "end": 13.94}, {"word": "carried", "start": 13.94, "end": 14.36}, {"word": "a", "start": 14.36, "end": 14.54}